(f)
the manner in which payment of interest in respect of Government securities is to be made and acknowledged;
(g)
the conditions governing the grant of duplicate, renewed, converted, consolidated and sub-divided Government
securities;
(h)
the fees to be paid in respect of the issue of duplicate Government securities and of the renewal, conversion,
consolidation and sub-division of Government securities;
(i)
