sub-division is to be acknowledged;
(j)
the manner of attestation of documents relating to Government securities in the form of stock;
(k)
the manner in which any document relating to a Government security or any endorsement or a promissory note issued
by [the Government]
[Substitued for the words the Central Government by the Public Debt (Central) Government Amendment Act, 1949 (6 of
1949), Section 6 (1-4-1949)]
