the circumstance and the manner in which and the conditions subject to which inspection of Government securities,
books, registers and other documents may be allowed or information therefrom may be given under section 25;
(n)
the procedure to be followed in making vesting orders;
(o)
the authority by whom the certificate referred to in the proviso to section 7 is to be granted and the manner of making the
inquiry therein mentioned;
